+        "## 8. Recipes (what to tell the user, step by step)\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "Recipes A, C (steps 2 and 4), E, F and G are **Mode A**: tell the user which app functions to use. Recipe B and the data parts of C/D are **Mode B**: you produce `.txt` content (section 12) and the user reloads with `↻`. In neither mode teach binary editing or the `▲ DADOS / EDITAR` panel.\n" +
