+        "## 9. Validation checklist (run it mentally before delivering data)\n" +
+        "\n" +
+        "1. Syntax: every `{` closes; keys are known; `$MPT_i` numbered 0.. consecutively; every frame has `$IMG`; the ANO has ≥ 1 frame.\n" +
