+        "3. Per frame: ≤ 10 `$HITS`; `$TIME` ≤ 255 (and present unless a frozen frame is intended); `$IMG` < number of `$SPR_` entries; `$OPT` `d1` ≤ 249 and a hitbox exists when `d1` matters.\n" +
