+        "8. New ANO numbers do not collide with existing ones or the reserved 201–255 effect range (unless intended).\n" +
+        "9. Reaction rows: 14 values/columns, speeds −128..127, `DUR` ≥ 1, `$ROW`/`$SZ` consistent when hand-editing.\n" +
