+        "3. Top-menu helpers: `CHAR`→`POS` changes distance/height between fighters (tests which projectile ANO spawns: normal/below/above) and `FLY`; `HITBOX` shows boxes (red hit, blue hurt, yellow others); `TEMPO` NORMAL/ESTENDIDO/ATAQUE (extended keeps the attacker on the last frame so you can see projectiles and the opponent's reaction to the end); `POUSO` ON/OFF; `TRANSIÇÃO` LIVRE/TRAVADA; `VIRAR` flips sides; `HIDE-EFF` hides effects; `FR-PREVIEW` ghost of previous/next frame; `TELA` grid/sounds/cutscenes options and a game-camera view; `CENTRO` camera modes.\n" +
