+         "Manages the sounds without picking one for a frame (to pick, use the Sound page of the sprite menu). Lists the character's sounds (WAVs in its folder, ids 80+) and the game's common sounds (se_ OGGs, ids 1 to 79 and 100 to 255). The + adds a sound: a character one (WAV) or a global one (OGG, which becomes the next free se_). Tapping an item opens the options: play, trim, more (volume, pitch, speed), replace and delete (the file becomes silence and stays in the folder, because the game loads the se_ files in sequence).",
