+         "Move options (ATK_FLAGS of the HDAT 4): grab (at the end of the initial ANO or only during the hit), projectile born on the opponent or under them, throw 3 projectiles (uses ANO, ANO+1 and ANO+2), projectile that only explodes on the floor, hitbox that destroys the opponent's and passing through the opponent. It only applies to the initial ANO of a move. It defines how the move is executed in the game, not how it is drawn.",
